  "text": {
    "letter": "My NarNory,\n\nYou make ordinary days feel special, and little moments become my favorite memories. If I could choose a thousand times, I would still choose you.\n\nThank you for being you, for the laughs, the talks, and all the little things that mean everything to me.\n\nI love you, today, tomorrow, and always. ♥",
    "heroTitle": "NarNory ♡",
    "heroSubtitle": "My favorite person in every version of life.",
    "songTitle": "Our special song",
    "songSub": "The song that reminds me of you",
    "surprise": "If I had one wish, it would be to collect a million more little moments with you. You are my favorite hello, my hardest goodbye, and my sweetest thought. ♡",
    "source": "narnory-memories"
  },
